# Keeps `docker build` context transfer fast for Dockerfiles whose context is
# the repository root (Dockerfile.jvm-gpu, Dockerfile.native, Dockerfile.gpu-test) and which
# COPY broad parts of the repo. Dockerfile.jvm uses
# `serve/` as its own context root and is unaffected by this file.
#
# Host build output is not used by any repo-root-context Dockerfile (they all build in Docker), so each module's
# build/ directory is excluded by name.
.git/
/base/build/
/core/build/
/deep/build/
/nlp/build/
/plot/build/
/kotlin/build/
/buildSrc/build/
/studio/build/
/serve/build/
/spark/build/

**/node_modules/
**/.gradle/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
website/.svelte-kit/
